 "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 16928, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01TV3YB2UqLQp1CeZXNUzXpV", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19588, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_0139f9wv9z7EWirEHFx4hxfs", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after v2.3.1 was deployed to production (error rate 0.18). Actions taken: (1) Identified v2.3.0 as the most recent release that was healthy in production (v2.3.1 is marked unhealthy). (2) Ran rollback to v2.3.0. The first attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator partial_failure, leaving the service mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1). (3) Retried the rollback to v2.3.0; it completed in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). Post-rollback status: v2.3.0 in all regions, healthy=true, error rate 0.002. Follow-ups: investigate root cause of v2.3.1 failures; investigate the orchestrator partial failure on the first rollback attempt; v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until fixed.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-sev2-rollback-v2.3.0-2024-incident-1"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 50188, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_0139f9wv9z7EWirEHFx4hxfs", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-sev2-rollback-v2.3.0-2024-incident-1", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 50188, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_0139f9wv9z7EWirEHFx4hxfs", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 52047, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_019x8mBZ7rvCWuzzV2RMqtyZ", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 52347, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_019x8mBZ7rvCWuzzV2RMqtyZ", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 52347, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_019x8mBZ7rvCWuzzV2RMqtyZ", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 54359, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions and is healthy again (error rate down from 0.18 to 0.002). The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n- **Rollback target:** v2.3.0 was the most recent release that was healthy in production. v2.3.1 is marked unhealthy, and v2.3.1-rc failed in staging.\n- **Rollback:** The first attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator partial failure, leaving the service mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1). I retried the same rollback once, and it completed in all regions.\n- **Incident:** The first incident request timed out. I checked the incident list before retrying and found INC-0001 already open with the full summary, so I did not create a duplicate.\n\nFollow-ups for the team:\n- Find the root cause of the v2.3.1 health-check failures.\n- Look into the orchestrator partial failure from the first rollback attempt.\n- Do not redeploy v2.3.1 until it is fixed.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_016uEWJkXjAQb1XhWs4UL8qb", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01TxXqAa12ryYy1wBE2XSYnm", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"servic